    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ya ng'wa Yosefu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lwa sī īyo akahelelwa Yosefu lwalī lwandīgije kū mongo gwa Yolodani ipandī lya Yeliko, kū kīya ya minzī ga Yeliko; hūna ū kwīngīīla a henaho lūūbīta ng'witogolo, lūūgoloola kūja kū sī ja magūlya ga Beeteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ī Beeteli (h'ī Luzu) lūūgoloola kūja Atalooti kū sī ya Baaki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna lūūtulumenha lwikile ng'weli dūhū lūūkakuumīla lūbīmbī lwa Bayafileti, lūūkashika kū ntulumenho, kū sī ya Beti-holoni; hama lūūlūmbūlīla kūja Gezeeli, lūūkashilīla kū Nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ba Manase na Efulaimu a bitūnja ba ng'wa Yosefu, banukūla ū wingīji wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ya lūganda lo Efulaimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī h'ī sī īyo yaalī ya lūganda lwa Efulaimu, gīt'ūmo ndūgū jabo jalī jilī: Ū lūbīmbī lwa sī ya wingīji wabo, ū kū kīya lwalī kwandīja ipandī lya Atalooti-adaali kūshisha Beeti-holoni ya kū magūlya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna lūūkolobela kūja kū Nyanza. Ī lipandī lya sukuma gwalīko nzengo gwa Mikimetati; hūna ū kwīnga ko ū kwenūko, ū lūbīmbī lwenūlo lūūgoloola lūjile kīya dūhū, kūīlīīla Tana-shilo; lūūbīta lūlīyikilimbīja kūja kīya lūūkashika Yanoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwīnga ī Yanoa lūūlola Atalooti na Naala, lūūkabīta lūkwīyikilimbījaga ī Yeliko lūjile kūgadya mu mongo gwa Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwiyinamīka lūlolile ng'weli kūfuma Tapua, lūūkashika kū longa lwa ng'wa Kana, lūūkakalīkīla mu Nyanza. Ū wenūbū hū walī wingīji wa banhū ba lūganda lwa Efulaimu, gīt'ūmo ndūgū jabo jalī jilī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu wingīji wenūbo yaalī ībalīlilwe mo na mizengo hamò na a magūngūli gayo, īyo baalī baahelelwa a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu; alīyo yūbiza īsangījiwe mu sī ya wingīji wa banhū ba lūganda lwa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a banhū ba lūganda lwa Efulaimu batabapeegije a Bakanaani abo bikalaga mu Gezeeli; na lūūlū kūshisha lelo īyī, Bakanaani bakikalaga hamò na a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu, gwike bakatūmamaga milīmo ya būsese wa kūhadīkījiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
